<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>Open 1.3.7 专用版</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>NotifyBubbles · Open 1.3.7</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>适配 Open 定制版 1.3.7。修改设置即时生效。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用悬浮气泡</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Enabled</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>显示与隐私</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>显示开关决定插件在哪些界面可见；锁屏及键盘弹出时插件栏自动隐藏。截屏隐藏仅作用于插件控件，不隐藏分屏 App，也可能影响录屏。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>主屏显示</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ShowOnHome</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>App 内显示</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ShowInApps</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>截屏隐藏气泡</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>HideInScreenshots</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>分屏与常用 App</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>横屏展开窗口出现时自动使用横屏布局，房子显示红色；仅识别窗口方向，不识别视频内容。Open 小窗大小与位置仍由 Open 管理。切换关闭功能仅关闭上一个展开的竖屏窗口，不终止后台；横屏、小窗和状态不明的窗口保留。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>选择常用 App</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>chooseFavorites</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>切换时关闭上一个竖屏窗口</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ClosePreviousSplit</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>操作说明</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>箭头：单击展开／折叠，左滑展开，上滑完全收纳，长按清后台。完全收纳后只留半露箭头，点按恢复；切换桌面、全屏或分屏不会自动伸出。
房子：单击显示／切换桌面，横屏布局下已有桌面时保持不动；上滑旋转下方 App，下滑旋转可确认的上方横屏 App，长按打开 Open 控制台。
App 图标：单击打开，长按移除图标并关闭对应 App；常用栏长按可调整顺序。从屏幕底边上划可关闭当前 Open 分屏。非分屏时可长按侧栏箭头清理后台。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>分屏定位 · 高级</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>一般无需调整。打开分屏后的校正时长设为 0 时仅校正一次；键盘收起后按设定延迟重新检查。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>分屏打开后校正总时长（秒）</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>SplitPlacementWindow</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>0.35</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>0.0</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>1.0</real>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>键盘收起后检查延迟（秒）</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>KeyboardRecheckDelay</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>0.1</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>0.0</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>0.5</real>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>热点 · 附加功能</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>仅在持续无设备连接达到等待时间后关闭热点；连接后停止计时，断开后重新计时。状态无法确认时不关闭，随插件总开关停用。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>热点无连接时自动关闭</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>HotspotAutoClose</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>无连接等待时间（分钟）</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>HotspotIdleMinutes</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>5</integer>
			<key>min</key>
			<integer>1</integer>
			<key>max</key>
			<integer>60</integer>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>气泡管理</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>清除插件气泡显示记录，不关闭 App 进程、不删除系统通知。后台列表后续会按插件现有规则刷新。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>清除全部气泡</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>clearBubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>诊断与排查</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>调试日志默认关闭；错误仍记录。日志约 1 MiB 轮转，保留当前与上一份。ARC 采样仅用于排查层级问题，不调整窗口。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>调试日志</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>DebugLogging</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>采样 ARC 层级（24 秒）</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>captureArcHierarchy</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
